  "name": "Chicken Enchiladas with Green Chile Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Rolled corn tortillas with creamy salsa verde sauce",
  "description": "Shredded roasted chicken and cheese are rolled in corn tortillas, covered with a creamy green chile sauce, and baked until hot and bubbling.",
